2026-11-24T16:06:57 | Claude chunk C | decision | New window keeps AppMode.Repo = null (follows the shared active project), not pinned to the opener's project.\nWhy: AppMode.Repo pins reads/writes via RtmComponent.WindowScope, but the side menu's project switch (Workspace.OpenTab) changes the global active root, so a pinned full window could not switch projects on its own without per-window active-project changes across Workspace and every page. Known limit: switching project in one full window switches it in all.
